        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.1概述"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                102,
                196,
                123
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "H3CLA2608-GM/GU室内无线网关（以下简称LA2608）可以为用户提供无线服务，为了实现对设备的管理，LA2608 需要通过3G/4G 网络连接到运营商无线控制器。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                139,
                138,
                905,
                175
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/6b7d9f7839bdb1e99e4bdfb6442a27056d32023930a2398e707ce8bb8fa9e2fc.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                188,
                186,
                213
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "说明"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                188,
                197,
                226,
                213
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "目前，LA2608只支持与H3C公司的无线控制器互通。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                142,
                224,
                564,
                241
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.2配置LA2608与无线控制器互通"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                282,
                484,
                302
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "如图1所示，LA2608安装了SIM卡，通过3G/4G网络连接到运营商无线控制器，并向用户提供无线服务。关于LA2608的安装方法，请参见“H3CLA2608室内无线网关快速安装指南”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                141,
                320,
                905,
                356
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "图1配置 LA2608 与无线控制器互通"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                141,
                362,
                431,
                378
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/f77ac9694696754bfdd191cd234fa33bd89ebc6ca8f50bf17dd1ac295bab6c6d.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
